{
  "name": "Undead Thralls",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You always have the Animate Dead and Summon Undead spells prepared and they do not count against the number of your prepared spells. When you cast Animate Dead, you can target one additional corpse or pile of bones, creating another zombie or skeleton, as appropriate.</p><p>Any undead creature you control has the following additional benefits:</p><ul><li>The creature's hit point maximum is increased by an amount equal to your wizard level.</li><li>The creature adds your Proficiency bonus to its weapon damage rolls.</li></ul>",
